ht, the motion settles into K2; frames after ~9.03 s (frame 271) are effectively the held K2 pose (last ~2.4 s are a hold of the final frame). The seed is IN the video (golden teardrop with a soft halo, sometimes a short light trail). seed[] = detected seed core centre per frame (tracked by yellow/halo with Viterbi continuity, hand-corrected where it passes her paws/nose); positions while the seed is down among the lit nest leaves (~1.3-3.0 s) are its partly hidden centre. nose[] = pink nose tip (hand-anchored 0-3.5 s, detected after). The engine bead should continue from seedLast at the end."}